## Output Formats

### TOON Format (Agent Mode)
```
error[1]{code,message}: "MISSING_REQUIRED_FLAG","--title is required"
help[1]: "{{ project_slug }} create --title \"...\""
```

### JSON Format
```json
{
  "error": {
    "code": "MISSING_REQUIRED_FLAG",
    "message": "--title is required"
  },
  "help": ["{{ project_slug }} create --title \"...\""]
}
```

### Human Format
```
Error: --title is required

Suggestion: {{ project_slug }} create --title "..."
```
